  "_about": "Heritage cluster for iDrive 7 plug-in hybrids (made on a 330e G21), generated by tools/gen_dials.py (edit that and regenerate): old and new, always in km/h, km and C (\"units\": \"metric\"). F80 M3-style dials: flat black faces, heavy white ticks, big bold numerals, orange-red needles, a linear 0-280 speedo; coolant in the speedo's sub-dial, oil in the tach's, ENGINE ON / OFF in the tach. Fuel (left edge) and the hybrid battery (right edge) as smooth tall bars. A framed dash in the middle: date, drive mode, the gear, engine a trip computer (distance, time, average speed, fuel per 100 km, estimated electric range) and a status pill: green ALL SYSTEMS OK, amber or red with the reason. Clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom. Widget reference: shared/hud.js.",
